ktoot (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public release: Mastodon notification widget for KDE Plasma 6.
  * KWallet access moved to pure QML/D-Bus (org.kde.plasma.workspace.dbus),
    C++ helper plugin removed — no compiled component, installs cleanly
    via a plain kpackagetool6 -i/-u.
  * Audit findings fixed: content-warning leak, marker loss, HTTPS
    enforcement, session race.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Thu, 03 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
